# p5 usage (v0.0.16): the budget table (fx reads a budget only for an fx login
# with a team, usage.zig:867-875@481104fd: here only because the seeded cache
# holds one) from a cache on disk for the harness's fake key, under the pinned
# clock (2026-10-12 15:30 UTC), so it reads the same on any day. Opening reads
# today alone (p5-usage-report.json, held 3 s); a fetch that brings no budget
# keeps the stored one (cache.zig merge, newest part wins). Table, selection,
# detail screen, next model, periods, r.
clock 1791819000000
fx: homefile .fx/usage-cache/c5482018bc3612f715c33c5a278e44485d3bc741118d70cfeff2c0aa3f94fc4e.json p5-usage-cache-budget.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/usage-cache/c5482018bc3612f715c33c5a278e44485d3bc741118d70cfeff2c0aa3f94fc4e.json p5-usage-cache-budget.json
usage p5-usage-report.json
models models.json
wait 2.5
type /usage
key Enter
wait 1
snap updating
wait 3.5
snap open
key Down
wait 0.5
snap down
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap detail
key Down
wait 0.5
snap detail-down
key Tab
wait 0.5
snap detail-tab
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap back
key Tab
wait 0.7
snap tab-today
key Tab
wait 0.7
snap tab-7d
key Right
wait 0.7
snap right-month
key Left
wait 0.7
snap left-7d
key r
wait 1
snap r-updating
wait 3.5
snap r
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap closed
home end
gwlog
